  "rationale": "P1 of the committee spec for normal flames, data-informed (not zero-shot): the carried pair of laws (the hinge law and the growth clock, equal weights) with the growth member's burner-limit weights corrected, and, for prefixes that carry the script's planned stop, the same two laws with their guessed stop times switched off and the stop handed to them as a known control at the stage sum minus 0.4 s. No member number is typed here: slot values are copied by tools/wsp/committee_edits.py. The typed numbers are the two weight vectors and the offset. No fit, no search; no validation outcome was read.",
